  "stem": "In the \\(xy\\)-plane, the graph of \\(y = 4x - 18\\) crosses the \\(x\\)-axis at the point \\((a, 0)\\). What is the value of \\(a\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "9/2"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "On the \\(x\\)-axis, \\(y = 0\\): \\(4a - 18 = 0\\).",
    "\\(4a = 18\\), so \\(a = \\frac{9}{2}\\), or 4.5."
